{"4463190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Breach", "steam_appid": 4463190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4463190/extras/f9ef900c09059e2d23e7bf2a6e6197a9.avif?t=1774494513\" width=796 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>you are a <strong>bullet</strong>... in a <strong>dungeon</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4463190/extras/d29e363429e7929dbf7b558ba29974b8.avif?t=1774494513\" width=456 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a living being you seek <strong>purpose,</strong> yours is exiting this dungeon... you will learn soon why...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4463190/extras/d8a0355932f0ac90e89de992c1a25d75.avif?t=1774494513\" width=526 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > you will <strong>dash</strong> through rooms of the dungeon, kill <strong>a lot </strong>enemies and collect <strong>secrets</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4463190/extras/7f3d9bc60af42eae717831b26c9be282.avif?t=1774494513\" width=573 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1-health</strong> you have 3 health in this game be careful these doesn't recover themselves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4463190/extras/7c62790bdf6e5fe9e8b9fe651cd50208.webp?t=1774494513\" width=52 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_pa